      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'd also like the ability to show the photos I take in VR to other people. In other words, it would be nice if you could select a photo in your album, and it would appear in your hand in the game. This could also be integrated with your feature request by allowing others to point at the photo and click on it to clone it to their album.",
      "viewerReactions": null
