  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It would be awesome to share recently snapped photos with the in game camera using the select avatar feature, and it would also save them to their photos gallery. \nI can't tell you how many times I've had to dip out of my headset to find someone on discord to send them a photo I just took. Would be a great in game feature.",
